      "extract": "The computation of the probability distribution of ToFs of quantum particles is one of the last areas where experts disagree about what quantum mechanics should predict. While a cornucopia of different ToF distributions exists in the literature, one rarely finds a discussion of the joint distribution of impact positions and ToFs studied in this work. In this paper, we have considered a Bohmian approach to this",
